{"data":{"type":"announcements","attributes":{"announcements":[{"id":866,"number":108,"language":0,"date":"2026-08-18T18:41:29.558Z","shortTitle":"New Role - Judge","title":"The Judge Has Spoken","subTitle":"Time to overrule your next meeting","pinState":0,"text":"ALL RISE! \n\nA new Crewmate role arrives as part of \u003cb\u003ev18.0.0\u003c/b\u003e - \u003cb\u003eJudge\u003c/b\u003e. Here's what you need to know about the update: \n\n- \u003cb\u003eOverrule Ability:\u003c/b\u003e Choose a Crewmate to eject no matter who's been voted for. Choose wisely - if they aren't the Impostor you get ejected instead! Complete tasks to enable your ability during meetings. \n\n- Use the new \u003cb\u003eMatch Info Guide\u003c/b\u003e located next to the settings icon to check the players, roles, and settings that have been chosen for the game. \n\n- We balanced the Detective role by adding a cooldown to their Interrogate ability after an Emergency Meeting ends. \n\nWe can't wait to see some judicial usage of the new ability - or wave goodbye as you double down on the wrong Crewmate. You can check out the complete details for this update on [https://www.innersloth.com/new-crewmate-role-the-judge-emergency-meeting-43/]our blog[] , and if you run into any issues send a ticket to [https://innersloth.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/requests/new]our helpdesk[] ! \n\nOff to find a powdered wig, \n \nDors from Innersloth","consoleTarget":0},{"id":850,"number":107,"language":0,"date":"2026-07-13T18:37:27.455Z","shortTitle":"Indie Time Again","title":"The Indie Cosmicube Returns","subTitle":"Celebrate Indie Games","pinState":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003eREJOICE CREWMATES!\u003c/b\u003e \n\nThe highly requested Indie Cosmicube is back. For \u003cb\u003e7000 Beans\u003c/b\u003e you can get your hands on cosmetics themed after many of our friends: \n\n- \u003cb\u003eIndie Cosmicube:\u003c/b\u003e Celebrate our collab featuring Untitled Goose Game, Undertale, Crypt of the NecroDancer, Celeste, Castle Crashers, Alien Hominid, and A Hat in Time. \n- This Cosmicube is only available for a limited time so get yours before it's gone \u003cb\u003eOctober 14, 2026 at 7:00 UTC.\u003c/b\u003e \n\nIf you need a refresher on how Cosmicubes work, check out our [https://innersloth.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/7094991564820-Currencies-Items-Stars-Beans-Cosmicubes-Explanation-]handy guide[] and if you run into any issues be sure to send us a [https://innersloth.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/requests/new]helpdesk ticket[] . For the full list of cosmetics you can unlock, [https://www.innersloth.com/the-indie-cosmicube-returns/]check out our blog[] ! \n\nDors from Innersloth","consoleTarget":0},{"id":834,"number":106,"language":0,"date":"2026-06-15T18:56:01.506Z","shortTitle":"8th Birthday","title":"8 Years of Among Us","subTitle":"Celebration-maxxing begins with all new things!","pinState":0,"text":"READY TO CELEBRATE, CREWMATES? \n\nAmong Us is 8 years old! Can you believe it? It feels like just yesterday we were watching baby spacebeans learn how to lie to each other... *sob* \u003ci\u003ethey betray each other so fast!\u003c/i\u003e Join the celebrations with: \n\n- \u003cb\u003eFREE BIRTHDAY GIFT:\u003c/b\u003e Lucky Number 8 Hat in Among Us inspired by some fashionable headwear. Giveaway ends on \u003cb\u003eJuly 16th at 06:59 UTC\u003c/b\u003e \n- Remember, if you haven't seen it yet, the Among Us Animated Show is available now on Paramount+. You can check out the first episode for free on YouTube \n- Check out our celebration stream on our [https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKuI2VapWQjkMz2DDrLvLKw]YouTube channel[] \n\n[https://www.innersloth.com/among-us-turns-8-new-demo-cosmetic/]Check our blog[] for all the details! We can't thank you enough for being with us as our spacebeans get older. You're the best! \u003c3 \n\nOff to slice pizza-cake, \n\nDors from Innersloth\n","consoleTarget":0},{"id":818,"number":105,"language":0,"date":"2026-06-05T18:10:30.798Z","shortTitle":"Among Us Animated Show","title":"Among Us Animated Show Out Now","subTitle":"Complete with new Showbiz cosmetics!","pinState":0,"text":"Are you ready Crewmates?! \n\nYou've begged. You've pleaded. You've cried. And now we can finally say it: \n\n- The Among Us Animated Show is \u003cb\u003eOUT NOW\u003c/b\u003e on Paramount+. You can watch the first episode FOR \u003cb\u003eFREE\u003c/b\u003e on YouTube! [https://www.innersloth.com/the-among-us-show-is-out-now/]More info on our blog.[] \n\n- Update your game to \u003cb\u003ev17.4.0\u003c/b\u003e and continue the chaos by getting the \u003cb\u003eShowbiz Cosmicube\u003c/b\u003e for \u003cb\u003e4000 Beans\u003c/b\u003e and dress up as your favorite Crewmate(?) from the show. \n\n- New decorations from the show are on The Skeld. Hooray! Surely nothing will go wrong! \n\n- Our space themed \u003cb\u003eCosmic Cosmicube\u003c/b\u003e is now available! Take a trip in a little rocket ship or get a new alien pet - you can't spell Cosmicube without Cosmic. Get these out of this world cosmetics for \u003cb\u003e70 Stars\u003c/b\u003e! \n\n- Among Us has achieved big age! Celebrate 8 years of tasks and betrayal with us on June 15th. We'll have a present waiting just for you~ \n\n- Remember to [https://www.innersloth.com/the-among-us-animated-show-arrives--emergency-meeting-42/]check our blog[] for all the exciting details! Send us a [https://innersloth.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/requests/new]helpdesk ticket[] if you have any trouble with the update. \n\nWaiting for the next episode, \n\nDors from Innersloth","consoleTarget":0},{"id":802,"number":104,"language":0,"date":"2026-04-01T18:49:43.771Z","shortTitle":"Nostalgia Mode","title":"Tasking like it's 2018","subTitle":"Nostalgia Mode has arrived for April Fool's","pinState":0,"text":"Is it just us... or did the Crewmates get older?\n\nIt's time for a trip down memory vent! April Fool's \u003cs\u003eDay\u003c/s\u003e Week is here and for the first time since 2021, our old sprites, cosmetics, and the classic Emergency Meeting call are back in the game. \u003ci\u003e*Breathes in*\u003c/i\u003e Smell that? That's \u003cb\u003enostalgia\u003c/b\u003e. Now you can tell your friends you've been here since Day 1, even if you're a liar.\n\nIt's time to fire up a lobby with your friends and re-live (or experience for the first time) the classic look and feel of Among Us. Get some games in quick though! The Crewmates and sprites go back to their modern look after \u003cb\u003eApril 8th at 17:00 UTC\u003c/b\u003e.\n\nIf you want to jump between looks, you can turn the mode on or off in the lobby creation menu.\n\nFor all the details, [https://www.innersloth.com/nostalgia-mode-arrives-for-april-fools/]check out our blog[] .\n\nTotally not pranking the team,\n\nDors from Innersloth","consoleTarget":0},{"id":786,"number":103,"language":0,"date":"2026-03-23T18:08:04.592Z","shortTitle":"New Hanami Cosmicube","title":"Hanami Cosmicube Blooms!","subTitle":"New threads for cherry blossom season","pinState":0,"text":"Cherry blossom season has arrived, Crewmates! \n\nWatch the flowers bloom with some gorgeous and cozy new fits in the \u003cb\u003eNEW Hanami Cosmicube\u003c/b\u003e. This new set of cosmetics costs \u003cb\u003e30 Stars\u003c/b\u003e, but be quick! The Cosmicube is only here for a limited time, so get yours before it's gone on \u003cb\u003eApril 23rd at 17:00 UTC\u003c/b\u003e. \n\nYour Crewmates will look ready for all the \u003cs\u003eterrifying\u003c/s\u003e festival activities. Just don't get caught by the Impostor while you enjoy the scenery. Read all the details about the Cosmicube on [https://www.innersloth.com/announcing-the-hanami-cosmicube/]our blog[] ! \n\nOff to enjoy some matcha, \n\nDors from Innersloth","consoleTarget":0},{"id":770,"number":102,"language":0,"date":"2026-03-09T18:56:03.955Z","shortTitle":"New Feedback Survey","title":"Take Our Player Feedback Survey!","subTitle":"Let your screams voices be heard.","pinState":0,"text":"Crewmates! \n\nAdmin just dropped a new task: [https://form.fillout.com/t/1QJ43YZAt2us]Take our player feedback survey![] (Also available in [https://form.fillout.com/t/x3TUFsDF6cus]Français[] - [https://form.fillout.com/t/wwcS2uRxTvus]Deutsch[] - [https://form.fillout.com/t/3jpKGr5jRMus]Español[] - [https://form.fillout.com/t/42NbRX9xeous]Português[] - [https://form.fillout.com/t/wZD1BtgMcVus]한국어[] - [https://form.fillout.com/t/kUEajFCW5Fus]日本語[] - [https://form.fillout.com/t/u9FsuTAQoZus]简体中文[] - [https://form.fillout.com/t/9Kx3Fcf7eUus]繁體中文[] .) \n\nIt'll take less time than finishing card swipe! If you have trouble using the links, [https://www.innersloth.com/new-task-take-our-player-feedback-survey/]check our website[] . \n\nThis is THE BEST way to have your thoughts about Among Us heard by the team. All the data goes into future updates, fixes, and plans! Be sure to fill it out now - the survey closes on March 23, 2026! \n \nWhat's the most fun for you? What isn't fun? Have you been enjoying the latest roles? Who keeps throwing pizza in the vents? Among Us isn't finished yet. There's more fun and chaos to create with your help. \n\nOkay, now stop reading and go fill it out... seriously... go now! \n\nStuck at my download task, \n \nDors from Innersloth","consoleTarget":0},{"id":754,"number":101,"language":0,"date":"2026-02-17T18:51:32.431Z","shortTitle":"More Ace Attorney","title":"Phoenix Wright has an objection!","subTitle":"If this is wrong, what is Wright?","pinState":0,"text":"\u003cb\u003eHOLD IT!\u003c/b\u003e \n\nThe one and only \u003cb\u003ePhoenix Wright\u003c/b\u003e is here to make sure you're cleared in the next Emergency Meeting. Remember to tell your best buds, because this collab will only stick around until \u003cb\u003eMarch 17th at 18:00 UTC!\u003c/b\u003e Check your inventories for these new FREE threads: \n\n- Phoenix Wright's Hair \n- Phoenix Wright's Suit \n\n\u003ci\u003eDressing as Phoenix Wright will not guarantee you will win nonsensical arguments, have coffee thrown at you in court, dramatic turnabouts, or survive ejections into the dark vacuum of space.\u003c/i\u003e Read the \u003cs\u003erest of this binding contract\u003c/s\u003e [https://www.innersloth.com/announcing-among-us-x-ace-attorney-again/]details on our blog[]! \n\nOff to find Maya and Gumshoe, \n\nDors from Innersloth","consoleTarget":0},{"id":738,"number":100,"language":0,"date":"2025-12-12T18:03:50.374Z","shortTitle":"2025 Recap","title":"Happy End of 2025, Crewmates!","subTitle":"A recap and reminder~","pinState":0,"text":"CREWMATESSSS!!! \n\nWE MADE IT! WE'RE ALIVE! WE SURVIVED THE IMPOSTORS FOR ANOTHER YEAR!!! \n\nThank you for a stellar 2025 full of fun updates, multiple vent cleaning claims, and you-definitely-not-asking-us-about-the-TV-show-and-where-it-is. (Shh... It's coming.) \n\nBefore we end for the year, here's a little housekeeping: \n- \u003cb\u003eNew Years Eve Drop:\u003c/b\u003e Our yearly tradition is coming! \u003cb\u003eGet a special, limited time NYE 2026 Hat for FREE when you log in starting December 26, 07:00 UTC.\u003c/b\u003e Ring in the new year with your Crewmates before the giveaway ends on January 31, 2026. \n- \u003cb\u003eSnowflake, Snowbean, and Gift Cosmicubes are BACK!\u003c/b\u003e Celebrate the winter holidays and snag them before they melt away on December 31. \n- \u003cb\u003eInnersloth Holiday:\u003c/b\u003e The team is on winter holidays now until January 5th, 2026. If you encounter any issues with the game during this time, our player support team will still be helping out! You can reach out to them at our [https://innersloth.zendesk.com/hc/en-us]helpdesk[] . \n\nWant to walk down memory with us and see all the \u003cs\u003ehorrors\u003c/s\u003e tasks we've completed this year? [https://www.innersloth.com/happy-end-of-2025-crewmates/]Check out our full blog post[] . Fun fact: this year, everyone on the Innersloth team are confirmed Crewmates. We think. \n\nAaaand that's it! Huge thanks to you all for supporting us, playing games, and doing all your tasks this year. The fact we've been able to keep working on Among Us after all these years is crazy - it's not often this happens, especially in the indie game space. \n\nWe're grateful! Can't wait to do 2026 chaos together! \n\nVictoria","consoleTarget":0},{"id":722,"number":99,"language":0,"date":"2025-11-18T18:34:21.422Z","shortTitle":"Stardew Cosmetics!","title":"Among Us x Stardew Valley Collab","subTitle":"Retire to the farm (to do more tasks)","pinState":0,"text":"WAKE UP CREWMATES, THE BIRDS ARE SINGING. \n \nDo you yearn for the cozy farm life, away from the sabotages of space? Then escape it all with our new Stardew Valley collaboration in v17.1.0. It has our two favorite things: tasks and NO Impostors. ​(Unless...?) \n \nThe [https://www.innersloth.com/announcing-among-us-x-stardew-valley/]Stardew Valley Cosmicube[] will be available for a limited time until Feb 18, 2026 at 17:00 UTC. And the best part? It's FREE - for only 3300 Beans, this bountiful harvest can be yours. \n\nFeaturing: \n- Junimo Pet \n- Krobus Pet \n- 14 Hats, 6 Skins, 4 Visors, 3 Nameplates \n\nGet it before it withers away, gone like the fleeting seasons. Remember once you claim the collab, it's yours to keep and unlock. Click [https://innersloth.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/13597476135700-How-do-I-use-Cosmicubes-and-get-cosmetics]here[] for more information on how Cosmicubes work. \n\n[https://www.innersloth.com/november-update-v17-1-0-the-longest-dev-log-in-the-world/]Update 17.1.0[] includes a fun, highly requested change to the Create Game screen: backgrounds have been updated to reflect the map chosen. \n\nEnjoy! I'm off to try and grow cranberries in space. \n\nFarmer Victoria","consoleTarget":0},{"id":706,"number":98,"language":0,"date":"2025-10-14T18:38:13.698Z","shortTitle":"v17.0.1 Fixes","title":"Small Fixes Update v17.0.1","subTitle":"A lil set of changes","pinState":0,"text":"Enjoying the new roles, Crewmates? \n\nWe have a little update live on all platforms with some smaller fixes. Make sure your game is updated to \u003cb\u003ev17.0.1\u003c/b\u003e, and then you can go back to solving (or committing) murders! \n\n- Updated role reveal SFX for the Detective and Viper. \n- Fixed friend request issues. \n- Minor bug and UI changes. \n\nFor the full list of changes, [https://www.innersloth.com/a-small-update-v17-0-1/]check our blog[] . Thanks for all your feedback on the roles so far! If you see any glitches or bugs remember to send us a [https://innersloth.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/requests/new]helpdesk ticket[] . \n\nNOW CATCH ME THAT VIPER! \n\nDors from Innersloth","consoleTarget":0},{"id":690,"number":96,"language":0,"date":"2025-09-10T18:20:50.836Z","shortTitle":"New Paimon Cosmetics​","title":"Among Us x Genshin Impact Collab​","subTitle":"It's time for some Paimonial wrath!​","pinState":0,"text":"A Crewmate obsessed with \u003cb\u003eGenshin Impact\u003c/b\u003e has become Impostor Paimon with their killer cosplay - and now you can join them!​\n​\nTell your friends because this free drop to celebrate Genshin Impact's Version Luna I launch only lasts until \u003cb\u003eOct. 10th 2025 at 17:00 UTC!\u003c/b\u003e We've automatically added the following items to your inventory and they're yours to keep forever:​\n​\n- Paimon Wig​\n- Paimon Costume​\n- Crest of the Best Travel Companion Nameplate​\n\nRead all about it on [https://www.innersloth.com/among-us-x-genshin-impact/]our blog[] and tell your crew! \n​\n\u003ci\u003ePlease note that Crewmates dressed as Paimon are not edible and should not be treated as Emergency Food.\u003c/i\u003e\n​\nOff to satisfy my Paimonial needs,​\nSofi-mon","consoleTarget":0},{"id":674,"number":95,"language":0,"date":"2025-09-09T18:20:52.19Z","shortTitle":"2 New Roles Arrive!","title":"Detective and Viper are on the scene!","subTitle":"Split up and look for clues... or melt them all away.","pinState":0,"text":"New roles! New Roles! NEW ROLES!\n\nIt's time for more content, Crewmates. \u003cb\u003e[https://www.innersloth.com/new-roles-are-on-the-scene-of-17-0-0--emergency-meeting-41/]Update 17.0.0[] \u003c/b\u003eis here with \u003cb\u003eTWO\u003c/b\u003e brand new roles! Make sure your game is updated so you can experience:\n\n- \u003cb\u003eNEW Crewmate Role - Detective:\u003c/b\u003e Use the \u003ci\u003e*Notes*\u003c/i\u003e ability to gather clues on Crewmate whereabouts, potential suspects, and what kind of Impostor committed the crime. Then use your \u003ci\u003e*Interrogate*\u003c/i\u003e skill to see if your suspect's alibi lines up. Put all this info together to eject those murderous Impostors!\n- \u003cb\u003eNEW Impostor Role - Viper:\u003c/b\u003e There won't be any clues to track when you use the \u003ci\u003e*Acid*\u003c/i\u003e ability to dissolve your victims. Be sneaky and use Sabotages to your advantage so the Crewmates never find the bodies. There's also a \u003cb\u003ebrand new kill animation\u003c/b\u003e for those of you on the receiving end of the Viper's spit (ewwwww).\n- \u003cb\u003eQuality of Life Updates:\u003c/b\u003e We've updated the *How to Play* guide, role settings, and Practice mode, to account for the new roles.\n- \u003cb\u003eBug Fixes:\u003c/b\u003e Fixed some issues with Crewmate colors while in the inventory and wardrobe.\n- Our \u003cs\u003eEmergency Food\u003c/s\u003e \u003cb\u003eGenshin Impact collab\u003c/b\u003e cosmetic drop arrives soon! Please don't eat Crewmates dressed like Paimon.\n \nPut your sleuthing skills to the test as the Detective! Just watch out, because a Viper could be waiting for you in the next vent. Read the details about the new roles on [https://www.innersloth.com/new-roles-are-on-the-scene-of-17-0-0--emergency-meeting-41/]our blog[] !\n\nDo you hear sizzling?\n\nDors from Innersloth","consoleTarget":0},{"id":658,"number":94,"language":0,"date":"2025-07-22T18:57:04.605Z","shortTitle":"Pusheen is back!","title":"Pusheen x Among Us","subTitle":"The most adorable cat returns","pinState":0,"text":"SHE'S BAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACK!!!! \n\nWe heard your cries, Crewmates - and so did Pusheen! We're collabing again to bring you the \u003cb\u003ePusheen Cosmicube\u003c/b\u003e for \u003cb\u003e110 Stars\u003c/b\u003e. With these cosmetics, you can dress up like Pusheen and her friends \u003cs\u003eand get away with every single crime because you're so dang cuuuuuuuuuuuute\u003c/s\u003e. \n\nPusheen can only hang out for a little bit, though, so make sure you get your Cosmicube before she leaves on \u003cb\u003eOctober 22 at 17:00 UTC!\u003c/b\u003e Check [https://www.innersloth.com/its-back--among-us-x-pusheen/]our blog[] for all the info on the collab. \n\nOff to give Pusheen scritches, \n\nDors from Innersloth","consoleTarget":0},{"id":642,"number":93,"language":0,"date":"2025-06-24T18:58:10Z","shortTitle":"Racing Cosmicube","title":"Bean fast. Bean furious.","subTitle":"A new Cosmicube races onto the scene","pinState":0,"text":"Crewmates and Impostors, start your engines! \r\n\r\nOur newest Cosmicube is here, and that means it's time to chase your need for speed: \r\n\r\n- \u003cb\u003eNEW Racing Cosmicube:\u003c/b\u003e Matching race suits and helmets themed after your favorite maps, new nameplates, new hats, and a \u003cb\u003eBEAN CAR PET!?!\u003c/b\u003e Get yours now for \u003cb\u003e50 Stars\u003c/b\u003e. \r\n\r\nThis Cosmicube is a permanent part of our cosmetic lineup, so the only thing you need to worry about is outracing the Impostor!  If you need a quick refresher on how to use Cosmicubes, hit the pit lane and read our [https://innersloth.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/13597476135700-How-do-I-use-Cosmicubes-and-get-cosmetics]helpdesk article[] . \r\n\r\nFor all things Racing Cosmicube, check out [https://www.innersloth.com/bean-for-speed-racing-cosmicube/]our blog[] ! \r\n\r\nRacing for bean-milia, \r\n\r\nDors from Innersloth","consoleTarget":0},{"id":626,"number":92,"language":0,"date":"2025-06-10T18:55:28.779Z","shortTitle":"Among Us turns 7!!","title":"Bring on the cake!","subTitle":"New cosmetics and Among Us' 7th birthday","pinState":0,"text":"THE CREWMATES ARE TURNING 7!!!! \n\nOur actual birthday is \u003cb\u003eJune 15th\u003c/b\u003e, but why not start celebrating early? Grab the balloons and confetti, cause our new update, \u003cb\u003e16.1.0\u003c/b\u003e, is out now: \n\n- \u003cb\u003eCelebrate Among Us' 7th Birthday:\u003c/b\u003e Get your free \u003cb\u003eCaked Up\u003c/b\u003e birthday hat before it's gone on \u003ci\u003eJuly 10 at 17:00 UTC\u003c/i\u003e. Join games on The Skeld to admire the decorations the Crewmates put up! \n\n- \u003cb\u003eNEW Cosmetics:\u003c/b\u003e 19 fun new fits are available for Beans in the in-game store. How about new sticky note visors or a beret? Maybe you need a snuggly new scarf? All these and more are available right now! \n\nBefore you run to spend all your Beans, there's one more thing! \u003cb\u003eWe're inviting you to a special live stream for Among Us' 7th birthday!\u003c/b\u003e We'll be making pizza-cake with \u003cb\u003eA REAL LIFE CREWMATE\u003c/b\u003e. You can get all the details about the stream and the cosmetics in [https://www.innersloth.com/crewmates-got-cake--among-us-7th-birthday/]our blog[] . \n\nTo all of you who have joined us for 7 years of tasks, deception, ejections, and sabotage: \n\n\u003cb\u003eYOU'RE THE BEST CREW WE COULD ASK FOR!! THANK YOU! \u003c3\u003c/b\u003e \n\nRunning for more cake, \n\nDors from Innersloth","consoleTarget":0},{"id":610,"number":91,"language":0,"date":"2025-05-20T18:47:59.705Z","shortTitle":"16.0.5 Update","title":"Small May Update","subTitle":"A new version... as a treat!","pinState":0,"text":"Hiya, Crewmates! \n\nVersion \u003cb\u003e16.0.5\u003c/b\u003e is now available on all platforms. This will help us keep the game running and assist with squashing bugs and hacks! Most of the changes are under the hood, so you won't notice any big differences. Here's what you might see, though: \n\n- Impostors and Shapeshifters can't kill through sabotaged doors on The Fungle anymore (you're safe for now, Crewmates!) \n- Hack fixes: we deployed anti-hacks and are keeping our visors peeled for any new sabotages so you can keep playing (with regular levels of anxiety). Big thank you to all the Crewmates who sent reports. \n- \u003cb\u003eUpdates for Kamurocho\u003c/b\u003e - we updated some Kamurocho cosmetic names along with a minor store image change (can you spot the difference?) \n\nYou can check out the details in [https://www.innersloth.com/may-update-a-smol-treat/]our blog[] . I'll give you a gold star if you do. \n\nIf you have trouble with this update or need assistance, send us a ticket at [https://innersloth.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/requests/new]our helpdesk[] . \n\nOff to help in Electrical,\n\nDors from Innersloth","consoleTarget":0},{"id":594,"number":90,"language":0,"date":"2025-04-01T18:58:04.824Z","shortTitle":"April Fools 2025","title":"ehT dlekS is here!","subTitle":"desufnoc m'I citoahc os s'ti pleH","pinState":0,"text":"Hi Crewmates!\n\nAPRIL FOOLS IS HERE. And this time? ehT dlekS is BACK until \u003cb\u003eApril 8 12:00AM PDT | 07:00 UTC!\u003c/b\u003e\n\nCelebrate the time of sabotage with the highly requested throwback to our original joke from 2021: a backwards version of The Skeld.\n- \u003cb\u003eNEW:\u003c/b\u003e Access ehT dlekS map from the matchmaking/game creation - it has automatically replaced The Skeld\n- April 1st 07:00 UTC - April 8th 07:00 UTC\n- deetnaraug noisufnoC\n\nDo you feel the nostalgia?? Are you ready to experience the eerie sensation of knowing a place but also not??? ARE YOU OKAY? AM I OKAY?? WHAT IS GOING ON??? RORRIM RUOY NI DEPPART M'I PLEH!!!!\n\n\u003ci\u003e**Admin has cut off comms**\u003c/i\u003e\n\nairotciV","consoleTarget":0},{"id":578,"number":89,"language":0,"date":"2025-03-25T18:11:54Z","shortTitle":"Matchmaking Update","title":"Updated Matchmaking \u0026 Kamurocho Cube!","subTitle":"Find your perfect match and killer new look","pinState":0,"text":"It's a match made in The Skeld, Crewmates!\r\n\r\nUpdate \u003cb\u003e16.0.0\u003c/b\u003e has arrived with it an unforgettable collab and better ways to find the perfect lobby:\r\n\r\n- \u003cb\u003e*NEW* Kamurocho Cosmicube:\u003c/b\u003e Our brand new collab with RGG Studio has arrived!​ Time to go on side quests and dress up as \u003cb\u003eKasuga\u003c/b\u003e, karaoke like \u003cb\u003eKiryu\u003c/b\u003e, or wreak havoc everywhere like \u003cb\u003eMajima\u003c/b\u003e. This cube is full of criminally cool cosmetics and more! Get yours for \u003cb\u003e110 Stars\u003c/b\u003e before it retires \u003cb\u003eJune 23, at 17:00 UTC\u003c/b\u003e.\r\n- \u003cb\u003eUpdated Matchmaking:\u003c/b\u003e A new way to create and find lobbies! Set your filters and find your perfect match by viewing settings before you join lobbies. Lobby creation and entering codes have a sleek new look too. If you need help on how it works, [https://innersloth.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/35117411022740-How-do-I-use-the-updated-Matchmaking-in-update-16-0-0]check out our tutorial[].\r\n- \u003cb\u003eNew Version Number:\u003c/b\u003e We're counting our version numbers in a new way starting today - no more v's!\r\n\r\nWant all the details? Be sure to check out our blog posts for [https://www.innersloth.com/a-match-made-in-update-16-0-0--emergency-meeting-40/]this update[] and [https://www.innersloth.com/announcing-among-us-x-rgg-studios--kamurocho-cosmicube/]the collab[]. If you run into any bugs remember to send us a ticket at our [https://innersloth.zendesk.com/hc/en-us]helpdesk[]!\r\n\r\nOff to sing Bakamitai,\r\n\r\nDors from Innersloth","consoleTarget":0},{"id":562,"number":88,"language":0,"date":"2025-02-24T18:59:39.334Z","shortTitle":"Player Survey Time","title":"New task: Help shape Among Us!","subTitle":"Take our player feedback survey","pinState":0,"text":"Hellooooo Crewmates (and Impostors)! \n\nTake our new [https://form.fillout.com/t/7dx6nVoDQsus]player feedback survey[] - don't worry, it's faster than starting the reactor! This is the \u003cb\u003eBEST\u003c/b\u003e way to make your thoughts on Among Us heard. If you're having trouble accessing the link [https://www.innersloth.com/take-our-player-feedback-survey/]check our blog[] . \n\nWe use the data to better inform future updates, fixes, and plans for the year so make sure you fill it out now - \u003cb\u003ethe survey will close on March 31st, 2025.\u003c/b\u003e \n\nWe want to know what is making Among Us the most fun for you? What's stopping your fun? Did you enjoy our new roles from last year? \u003cs\u003eWhy does someone always call a meeting at the start of the game?\u003c/s\u003e \n\nThere's are still so many ways for Among Us to grow - help shape it with your 10000 IQ. \n\nGot it? Good. Now fill it out. DO IT. GO GO GO GO GO. \n\nOff to grab a slice, \n\nDors from Innersloth","consoleTarget":0}]},"timestamp":"2026-09-24T19:54:23Z"}}
